markdown <<MARKDOWN
You are building a model to predict whether a friend will like a book, given the training data below. Which of these questions is the best one for a decision tree to ask first?

| Pages | Series? | Liked? |
|---|---|---|
| 120 | yes | yes |
| 300 | yes | yes |
| 150 | no | no |
| 280 | no | no |
| 200 | yes | yes |
| 320 | no | no |
MARKDOWN

